{"unit_id":"new-256__codebuddy-bridge#feature-1","repo":"new-256/codebuddy-bridge","commit":"5fda415b1cbad0bd4b8ab7e25511c5f205ec7671","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"CodeBuddy First Bridge 的功能「运行本地开发任务」：DSH 的运行工具把编码、构建、调试或排查提示交给所选本机 CLI，并返回最终答复；可设置工作目录、模型、执行模式、超时或后台运行。","source":"generated","evidence":["preset/codebuddy-first/codebuddy-first-bridge.mjs:352-374"]}
{"unit_id":"new-256__codebuddy-bridge#feature-2","repo":"new-256/codebuddy-bridge","commit":"5fda415b1cbad0bd4b8ab7e25511c5f205ec7671","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"CodeBuddy First Bridge 的功能「续接已有对话」：续接工具根据会话 ID 或最近会话继续工作，并沿用原会话对应的后端；用户提供后续提示后可取回新答复。","source":"generated","evidence":["preset/codebuddy-first/codebuddy-first-bridge.mjs:376-406"]}
{"unit_id":"new-256__codebuddy-bridge#feature-3","repo":"new-256/codebuddy-bridge","commit":"5fda415b1cbad0bd4b8ab7e25511c5f205ec7671","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"CodeBuddy First Bridge 的功能「查看项目活动」：状态工具返回各项目当前运行状态、正在执行的步骤、近期轨迹、最近结果和累计 token 用量；也可按工作目录筛选。","source":"generated","evidence":["preset/codebuddy-first/codebuddy-first-bridge.mjs:408-422"]}
{"unit_id":"new-256__codebuddy-bridge#feature-4","repo":"new-256/codebuddy-bridge","commit":"5fda415b1cbad0bd4b8ab7e25511c5f205ec7671","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"CodeBuddy First Bridge 的功能「显示状态灯与配置面板」：家级插件汇总会话状态并提供浏览器状态灯和设置界面，可查看项目活动并调整默认后端、模型及相关设置。","source":"generated","evidence":["home-plugin/codebuddy-indicator/lib/index.mjs:1-60"]}
{"unit_id":"new-256__codebuddy-bridge#caveat-1","repo":"new-256/codebuddy-bridge","commit":"5fda415b1cbad0bd4b8ab7e25511c5f205ec7671","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"CodeBuddy First Bridge 使用所选本机 CLI 执行任务；preset 描述其默认采用非交互模式，按配置模式决定是否允许编辑文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["preset/codebuddy-first/codebuddy-first-bridge.mjs:352-359"]}
